 24/7\n, including\nSaturdays and Sundays\n, and specialty appointments Monday through Friday.\nNew Patients Always Welcome!\nCall\n(704) 815-3939\nYour Pet is Our Priority\nAt\nCarolina Veterinary Specialists\nin Matthews, we deliver excellence in veterinary care, because your pet deserves nothing less.\nAdvanced Specialty Veterinary Services\nLearn More\nEmergency Veterinary Care\nLearn More\nIn-House Lab & Diagnostics\nLearn More\nComprehensive Referral Care\nLearn More\nCarolina Veterinary Specialists in Matthews Welcomes Patients 7 Days A Week, Including Saturdays and Sundays\nWe offer the referral services of board-certified veterinary specialists during weekday hours. We are also staffed with emergency veterinarians to provide your pet with comprehensive emergency care when your primary care veterinarian is unavailable.\nAbout Our Hospital\n\"Took great care of our fur baby on the biggest holiday of the year. And even though we’re now dealing with the diagnosis and management of diabetes, they were great to make sure we knew how to care for her now. Kudos!\"\n- Nelson B.\nAdvanced Veterinary Care by Board-Certified Specialists\nFrom neurology to surgery to oncology and more, we have collected the most highly-qualified board-certified veterinary specialists in a wide range of specialties.\nWe work closely with your primary care veterinarian to provide therapies for the most challenging medical conditions. With an emphasis on quality and service, we provide the most sophisticated veterinary care possible.\nView All Specialties\nCarolina Veterinary Specialists\nin Matthews is Open 7 Days a Week, Including Saturday & Sunday\n24/7 Emergency Services\nMonday:\n24 hours\nTuesday:\n24 hours\nWednesday:\n24 hours\nThursday:\n24 hours\nFriday:\n24 hours\nSaturday:\n24 hours\nSunday:\n24 hours\nSpecialty Services\nMonday to Friday from 8am to 5pm.\nAddress\n4099 Campus Ridge Rd\nMatthews\nNC\n28104\nUS\nPhone\n(704) 815-3939\nContact Us\nCarolina Veterinary Specialists\nin Matthews\nCaring for Pets in Matthews\nCarolina Veterinary Specialists\nin Matthews accepts new clients to our specialty services by referral only. Our emergency service accepts all clients.\nContact Us\nHome\nAbout\nSpecialties\nEmergencies\nDiagnostics\nReferrals\nCareers\nContact\nCarolina Veterinary Specialists\n4099 Campus Ridge Rd\nMatthews\nNC\n28104\nUS\nTerms and Conditions\nDo Not Sell or Share My Personal Information\nPrivacy Policy\nAccessibility\nSearch\nSitemap\nBack to Top\nFacebook\nInstagram\nCopyright © 2026. All Rights Reserved.\nPart of the\nPetVet Care Centers Network\n.\n(704) 815-3939\nContact\nOpen Menu\nClose Menu",
